      "widgets_values": [
        "3D render, Pixar-style cartoon illustration of a cute white bunny standing upright in a fantasy forest, facing the camera with soft, curious eyes and a gentle smile. The bunny wears a snug orange t-shirt with bold white text reading “PIXA” across the chest, the letters clean and slightly rounded. Its ears are long and fluffy, twitching slightly as if attentive to ambient sounds. Behind it, towering mushroom-like trees with vibrant caps in shades of purple, green, and yellow rise into a misty canopy, their stems thick and textured like gnarled wood. The foreground is carpeted in mossy ferns and glowing blue dewdrops catching morning light. Soft golden sunlight filters through the leaves from above, casting warm dappled shadows on the ground. The scene is bathed in a dreamy, ethereal glow with pastel tones blending seamlessly—soft greens, earthy browns, and radiant oranges. The finish is smooth and polished, with subtle highlights on fur and fabric, giving the image a magical, storybook feel. The mood is peaceful, whimsical, and inviting, as if the bunny is welcoming you into its enchanted world."
